  "prefLabel": "Res 8403.07 GPS/GIS Map Data",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 8403.07 GPS/GIS Map Data. By October 2016 all clubs shall have their trail system mapped using GPS tracks and submit the information to the bureau annually. Clubs that have not provided trail locations in GPS, or other acceptable format, shall not be eligible for grant funds starting in 2017. Trails shall not need to be mapped using GPS tracks annually, but a GPS track quality map shall be provided annually and data for trail reroutes provided.\n\nSource. #9350, eff 12-24-08; ss by #10850, eff 6-17-15",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/res8100-8500.html"
}
